<amll:meta key="appleMusicId" value="152197408"/></metadata></head><body dur="2:55.720"><div begin="20.002" end="43.360" itunes:songPart="Verse"><p begin="20.002" end="25.725" itunes:key="L1" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="20.002" end="20.211">为</span><span begin="20.211" end="21.312">什么你</span><span begin="21.312" end="21.546">总</span><span begin="21.546" end="21.949">沉</span><span begin="21.949" end="22.695">迷</span><span begin="22.695" end="23.200">于某种</span><span begin="23.200" end="23.510">神</span><span begin="23.510" end="23.819">奇</span><span begin="23.819" end="24.163">的</span><span begin="24.163" end="24.465">幻</span><span begin="24.465" end="25.725">想</span></p><p begin="25.735" end="31.666" itunes:key="L2" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="25.735" end="26.202">那是</span><span begin="26.202" end="26.966">躲也</span><span begin="26.966" end="27.286">躲</span><span begin="27.286" end="27.509">不</span><span begin="27.509" end="28.586">掉 牙痛</span><span begin="28.586" end="29.033">一</span><span begin="29.033" end="29.541">般强</span><span begin="29.541" end="29.782">烈</span><span begin="29.782" end="30.458">的欲</span><span begin="30.458" end="31.666">望</span></p><p begin="31.676" end="37.025" itunes:key="L3" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="31.676" end="32.131">外面</span><span begin="32.131" end="32.429">人</span><span begin="32.429" end="32.695">生</span><span begin="32.695" end="33.032">沸</span><span begin="33.032" end="33.405">腾</span><span begin="33.405" end="33.949">如</span><span begin="33.949" end="34.688">潮涨</span> <span begin="34.688" end="35.088">百般</span><span begin="35.088" end="35.432">无</span><span begin="35.432" end="35.690">聊</span><span begin="35.690" end="36.390">好喧</span><span begin="36.390" end="37.025">闹</span></p><p begin="37.035" end="43.360" itunes:key="L4" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="37.035" end="37.668">你</span><span begin="37.668" end="38.746">目眩神</span><span begin="38.746" end="39.082">迷</span> <span begin="39.082" end="39.333">说</span><span begin="39.333" end="40.096">不知</span><span begin="40.096" end="40.512">道</span> <span begin="40.616" end="41.008">只显</span><span begin="41.008" end="41.773">得</span><span begin="41.835" end="42.292">可</span><span begin="42.292" end="43.360">笑</span></p></div><div begin="43.370" end="1:09.866" itunes:songPart="Verse"><p begin="43.370" end="49.362" itunes:key="L5" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="43.370" end="44.031">为什</span><span begin="44.031" end="44.988">么你会</span><span begin="44.988" end="45.232">相</span><span begin="45.232" end="45.635">信</span><span begin="45.635" end="46.500">每件事</span><span begin="46.500" end="46.899">都有</span><span begin="46.899" end="47.545">解决</span><span begin="47.545" end="48.164">的办</span><span begin="48.164" end="49.362">法</span></p><p begin="49.372" end="55.344" itunes:key="L6" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="49.372" end="49.889">这就</span><span begin="49.889" end="50.914">好像吞</span><span begin="50.914" end="51.207">进</span><span begin="51.207" end="51.904">鲑鱼</span> <span begin="51.904" end="52.271">却</span><span begin="52.271" end="52.664">卡</span><span begin="52.664" end="52.865">在</span><span begin="52.865" end="53.285">喉</span><span begin="53.285" end="53.513">咙</span><span begin="53.513" end="54.170">的中</span><span begin="54.170" end="55.344">央</span></p><p begin="55.354" end="1:00.773" itunes:key="L7" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="55.354" end="55.821">有千</span><span begin="55.821" end="57.043">百种可能</span><span begin="57.043" end="57.924">无解</span><span begin="57.924" end="58.366">答</span> <span begin="58.366" end="58.784">你去</span><span begin="58.784" end="59.190">挪</span><span begin="59.190" end="59.386">威</span><span begin="59.386" end="1:00.442">找鱼算</span><span begin="1:00.442" end="1:00.773">帐</span></p><p begin="1:00.783" end="1:09.866" itunes:key="L8" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="1:00.783" end="1:01.464">又</span><span begin="1:01.464" end="1:02.827">一头钻进</span><span begin="1:02.827" end="1:03.068">了</span><span begin="1:03.068" end="1:03.709">犀牛</sp